# PULSE Gold Template Selection

> **Template shape law:** `GOLDEN_TEMPLATE_TOP10.md` · `GOLDEN_TEMPLATE_QA.md`  
> **Pipeline process:** `.cursor/rules/pipeline-template-law.mdc`

**Router:** `_pulse_gold_template_router.js` → `pickGoldTemplate(id, body, title)`

Classify **before** generation. Lock `template`, `goldId`, `reason`. Never switch mid-run.

| Condition | Template | Spec |
|-----------|----------|------|
| Title + body ranking markers | **Top 10** | `GOLDEN_TEMPLATE_TOP10.md` |
| Body ranking markers without title | **Top 10** | `GOLDEN_TEMPLATE_TOP10.md` |
| Essay/Q&A body | **Q&A** | `GOLDEN_TEMPLATE_QA.md` |
| Title says "best" but body is essay | **Q&A** (never Top 10) | `GOLDEN_TEMPLATE_QA.md` |

```javascript
const { pickGoldTemplate } = require('./_pulse_gold_template_router');
const route = pickGoldTemplate(id, body, title);
// route.template === 'top10' | 'qa' | null
```
